      "content": "vague lol. like, if you look at where consumer trends are going, isn't staying neutral basically seen as a huge risk to the brand's reputation nowadays? seems like being \"neutral\" just looks like we don't care about the planet. wouldn't it be more logical to just back the bill and lean into the positive PR instead of playing it safe?",
